{'symbol': 'CI', 'date': '2021-09-02 11:15:00', 'title': 'CIGNA AND HARTFORD HEALTHCARE REACH AGREEMENT TO KEEP QUALITY CARE AFFORDABLE', 'text': "HARTFORD, CONN., SEPT. 2, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0CIGNA (NYSE: CI) AND HARTFORD HEALTHCARE HAVE REACHED A MULTI-YEAR AGREEMENT THAT ENSURES CIGNA CUSTOMERS WILL HAVE CONTINUED ACCESS TO HARTFORD HEALTHCARE'S HOSPITALS, FACILITIES AND PROVIDERS FOR QUALITY CARE AT PREDICTABLE, AFFORDABLE RATES."}